\section{Not covered}{

Common Crop Names, Germplasm Attribute Values, Planned Crosses,
Plates and Vendor Samples have no wrapper. \code{POST} and \code{PUT} write
endpoints are out of scope by design. \code{\link[=brapi_get]{brapi_get()}} and
\code{\link[=brapi_post_search]{brapi_post_search()}} reach anything not wrapped here.
}

